{"id": "EUVD-2026-86211", "enisaUuid": "182bdc83-93f7-3ba1-85ee-fe5edb337e46", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nPCI: iproc: Protect root bus removal with rescan lock\n\nHold the pci_rescan_remove_lock lock while stopping and removing a root bus\nto avoid racing with concurrent rescan or hotplug operations triggered via\nsysfs.  Such races may lead to use-after-free issues or system crashes.\n\n[bhelgaas: commit log]", "datePublished": "2026-09-24T16:03:00", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-03T10:57:53", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e7d9d7be2c1f8d434032983bc86a05805178c9c9", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1618e374ba4c7117c04662422ef985e9d64e2466", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4e1d34d824050a4e700ca442f815a95d9f214b83", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/aaf4153caed9f1760b9f266612b0599bfd97150c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bd2bf1e0d973c93fc1637b90cbb9a5a5f6884bd3", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ee06aafc2d760a4ee023e0b2e95ce1ec71bddc6c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a6a64e150f12ad5391e0a0d60f6a3d119b06ce50"], "aliases": ["GHSA-cg47-h57j-rvmx", "CVE-2026-93822"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0edf4f6d-2667-3cb5-a1f8-e943284651ec", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1fb37a8178da007cad75f48e2355b9dcb0711e06 <ee06aafc2d760a4ee023e0b2e95ce1ec71bddc6c"}, {"id": "0fea27c2-fdbd-3f28-9242-33c8899e9648", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1fb37a8178da007cad75f48e2355b9dcb0711e06 <bd2bf1e0d973c93fc1637b90cbb9a5a5f6884bd3"}, {"id": "29c81b0a-87fe-3380-b116-1d7d361ada44", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1fb37a8178da007cad75f48e2355b9dcb0711e06 <a6a64e150f12ad5391e0a0d60f6a3d119b06ce50"}, {"id": "2b8f7450-22d4-3776-b4da-d147e3f75c3b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1fb37a8178